  "body": "Independent native wave64 FP16 AWQ GEMM checkpoint. The complete source template, address/ownership components, launch bounds and first six scalar instructions are Lean checked; this release issues zero complete AWQ source certificates. Full execution, actual whole-trace race freedom and dense-reference equality remain unfinished.\n\nPaired MI350 numerical validation: 120 launches and 820,224 CPU float64 output comparisons, no failures at atol=rtol=0.002, no cross-host FP16 bit differences, and all inputs/allocation guards preserved. Ten altered numerical packets are rejected. Four finite symbolic launches check 18,048 output expressions and 359,424 trace events. The standalone source archive rebuilds eight owned modules and four complete source instances, reproducing 90 axiom audits and six false-source rejections without Git or an owned compiled cache.\n\nAssets contain frozen inputs and exact native sources, both hosts' raw outputs and captured compiler input closures, and the standalone Lean source project. Source and numerical packets are independent adaptations; original PTX/model/NVIDIA paper results are not asserted. No model calls were made.\n"
